  {
   "title": "China Television HQ",
   "text": "The company moved its headquarters to Nangang in 1986; the main building opened on 2 Feb 1987 and the second building was completed in 1999. Walls, glass crown and mast are traced from one Commons photo; the gold lettering is not drawn.",
