    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Everyday blocks",
   "text": "Older apartments on Chongyang Road have grey-white walls, window grilles, air-conditioner units and shops at street level. Storey counts (5) are illustrative: OpenStreetMap has no heights for 66 of the 68 buildings.",
   "links": [
    {
     "label": "Commons photo, Chongyang Road",
